<title>USA: Noranda hikes US aluminum prices for March.</title>
<headline>Noranda hikes US aluminum prices for March.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Noranda Aluminum Inc said it has raised its list prices for aluminum ingot and billet from March 1 to 84 and 94 cents per pound, respectively.</p>
<p>This represented an increase of three cents on both products from February.</p>
<p>On Friday Alcan Aluminium announced that its March prices were unchanged from February's 81 cents per pound for ingot and 91 cents for billet.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
